---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import NeonTag from '../components/NeonTag.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About — Rezvan Joshaghani"
  description="PhD candidate in Computer Science at Boise State University. Research in neural rendering, 3DGS compression, and XR education."
  currentPage="About"
>
  <div class="page-content fade-in">
    <h1 class="page-title font-outfit">About</h1>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-left">
        <div class="photo-frame gradient-animated">
          <img src="/images/avatar.jpeg" alt="Rezvan Joshaghani" class="photo-img" />
        </div>
        <div class="contact-info">
          <div class="contact-item">
            <div class="contact-label font-outfit">Email</div>
            <div class="contact-value font-outfit">rezvanjoshaghani@u.boisestate.edu</div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-item">
            <div class="contact-label font-outfit">Location</div>
            <div class="contact-value font-outfit">Boise, Idaho</div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-item">
            <div class="contact-label font-outfit">Advisor</div>
            <div class="contact-value font-outfit">Steve Cutchin</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-right font-crimson">
        <p>
          I'm a PhD candidate in Computer Science at Boise State University, working with
          <span class="text-strong">Steve Cutchin</span>. My research focuses on making 3D scene
          representations more efficient and exploring how immersive technologies can transform STEM education.
        </p>
        <p>
          On the rendering side, I'm developing
          <span class="neon-inline" style="--neon-color: #00F0FF;">Triangle-DCT</span>, a compression
          pipeline for Triangle Splatting that uses energy-based DCT coefficient selection. I'm also building
          <span class="neon-inline" style="--neon-color: #FF3CAC;">complexity-aware loss functions</span>
          for 3D Gaussian Splatting that adapt to scene difficulty, evaluated across a 32-scene benchmark.
        </p>
        <p>
          On the education side, I led a three-arm RCT evaluating
          <span class="neon-inline" style="--neon-color: #22D65A;">XR-based glove hygiene training</span>
          for chemistry labs, published at IEEE VR 2026. VR reduced anticipatory anxiety without shifting
          self-efficacy — a theoretically meaningful finding through Control-Value Theory.
        </p>
        <p class="last-para">
          I also co-founded
          <span class="neon-inline" style="--neon-color: #FFE03D;">Elevated</span>, an AI-powered
          scholarship matching platform. Before grad school, I built enterprise dashboards at Symantec
          and contributed to projects like the Atlas of Drowned Towns.
        </p>
        <div class="tag-row">
          <NeonTag color="#00F0FF">3D Gaussian Splatting</NeonTag>
          <NeonTag color="#FF3CAC">Neural Rendering</NeonTag>
          <NeonTag color="#22D65A">Compression</NeonTag>
          <NeonTag color="#FFE03D">XR/VR</NeonTag>
          <NeonTag color="#845EF7">STEM Education</NeonTag>
          <NeonTag color="#00F0FF">HCI</NeonTag>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .photo-frame {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 2px;
  }

  .photo-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: var(--photo-bg);
  }

  .contact-info {
    margin-top: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .contact-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .contact-value {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--secondary);
  }

  .about-right {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-right p {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-right .last-para {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .text-strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .neon-inline {
    color: var(--neon-color);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] .neon-inline {
    text-shadow: 0 0 12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--neon-color) 30%, transparent);
  }

  .tag-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .photo-frame {
      max-width: 200px;
    }
  }
</style>
